<title>INDONESIA: Jababeka first-half net edges up.</title>
<headline>Jababeka first-half net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit 65.13 vs 61.97</p>
<p>Earnings per share (in rupiah) 121 vs 81  </p>
<p>    Revenues				180.31 vs 179.02</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     64.40 vs 73.84</p>
<p>    Income tax			     13.31 vs 24.12</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is PT Kawasan Industri Jababeka.</p>
</text>
